    <div class="egg-gt" style="color:#e2d9ff;margin:4px 0 4px">NETWORK INTERFERENCE</div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">Rogue signals are jamming the airspace above the room. You're the pod — clear the channel. Jammers rain static, splitters multiply, and every fourth wave the FIREWALL sweeps in. Downed signals drop powered displays: relay shield, dual beam, the piercing LANCE and the wide-angle SWEEP.</p>
