    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">Shares keep coming. Compose the workspace — complete a row and it renders to the display. Hold a piece for later, trust the ghost, and slam it home when you're sure.</p>
    <div class="egg-stage"><canvas id="egg2c" width="640" height="560"></canvas></div>
