    <div class="egg-gt" style="color:#e2d9ff;margin:4px 0 4px">RELAY RUN</div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">Aliens are looting Earth's audiovisual gear, and someone has to invoice them for it. You're the AV Integrator: fight through three decks of their freighter, shoot the capsules open, and take the equipment back — HDMI becomes a Blaster, a Display fans into Multicast, Coil fires Fiber, a Speaker is pure Subwoofer. Switches level your weapon, Surges take one hit for you. Snatchers steal; make them regret it. A boss holds every deck.</p>
    <div class="egg-stage"><canvas id="eggc" width="880" height="520"></canvas></div>
    <div style="font-size:11px;color:#8f85b8;margin-top:8px">score: <b id="eggs" style="color:#7ce3a8">0</b> · mission: <b id="egglv" style="color:#e8c76a">1</b>/3 · best: <b id="eggb" style="color:#a58cff">0</b></div>
