    <div class="egg-gt" style="color:#e2d9ff;margin:4px 0 4px">PACKET MUNCHER</div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">Something is nesting in the farthest switch fabric. Run the corridors, eat every stray packet, and mind the four interference glyphs — each hunts its own way. Grab a powered display and, for a few seconds, the hunters become the hunted. Ten sectors between you and a clean network.</p>
    <div class="egg-stage"><canvas id="egg4c" width="560" height="620"></canvas></div>
