</div>
<div id="egg5" style="display:none">
  <div class="egg-bd big fit">
    <button class="egg-x" onclick="eggBackToMenu()">✕</button>
    <button class="egg-snd" onclick="eggToggleMute()" aria-label="Toggle sound (M)"></button>
    <div class="kicker" style="color:#e8c76a">Venus · broadcast campus</div>
    <div class="egg-gt" style="color:#e2d9ff;margin:4px 0 4px">SIGNAL JUMPER</div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">Ten displays across the broadcast campus went dark, and the interference is walking around like it owns the place. Run the loading dock, the cable trench, the rooftop, the mezzanine and the antenna tower, then push on through the uplink yard, the static fields, the rack canyon, the microwave bridge and master control — stomp the glyphs flat, bank the signal bits, bump the cache blocks, plant the midpoint flag, ride the ferries, and touch every display back to Polaris green. Game over offers a CONTINUE from the top of the level that beat you.</p>
    <div class="egg-stage"><canvas id="egg5c" width="880" height="520"></canvas></div>
    <div style="font-size:11px;color:#8f85b8;margin-top:8px">score: <b id="egg5s" style="color:#7ce3a8">0</b> · level: <b id="egg5lv" style="color:#e8c76a">1</b>/10 · lives: <b id="egg5l" style="color:#a58cff">3</b> · bits: <b id="egg5bt" style="color:#7fc6dd">0</b> · best: <b id="egg5b" style="color:#e2d9ff">0</b></div>
