</div>
<div id="egg6" style="display:none">
  <div class="egg-bd big fit">
    <button class="egg-x" onclick="eggBackToMenu()">✕</button>
    <div class="kicker" style="color:#7fc6dd">Earth · search and rescue</div>
    <div class="egg-gt" style="color:#e2d9ff;margin:4px 0 4px">THE LOST DISPLAY</div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#b8aede;margin:0 0 10px">The campus's flagship display was stolen and walled up in a fortress beyond the north-east mesa. Cross a hundred screens of field, woods, river and dead server yard, crimper in hand — find the two small keys, mind the spikes, arrows and false floors, put five strikes into the CRT TYRANT's open screen, and raise the display where it belongs. Five hollow caves hide heart containers, and the RELAY TOWER on the south-west shore keeps the MERSIVE POLARIS — press X to grab what's in front of you, or to send the puck flying out and back.</p>
